// Probabilistic Primitives Basic Tests
//
// Tests for Beta distribution and KL divergence from prob::primitives.
// All functions inlined — tests cannot import stdlib.
//
// Verified properties:
//  1. Beta(2,5) mean = 2/7 ≈ 0.2857, within 0.001
